  MENUITEM "Trim process tree...",2022
  MENUITEM "Inspect threads",2010
  MENUITEM "Back to processes",2011
  MENUITEM "Open file location",2012
  MENUITEM "File properties",2013
  MENUITEM "Write minidump...",2014
  MENUITEM "CPU cap: 20%...",2015
  MENUITEM "Remove our CPU cap...",2016
